{"id": "69104", "title": "十年后的新欢：旧爱", "author": "化外之国", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 26, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/69/69104.htm", "intro": "相爱的情人之间也需要纵横捭阖的底气，\r\n犹如高手过招，重要的不是招，而是心。\r\n周放为了追媳妇儿可以从大学到高中当卧底，\r\n可以为了爱蛰伏隐忍多年。\r\n莫铭初见他，仍然是优雅、清冷而矜贵，\r\n却不知道金玉面目的背后永远藏着一个败絮的极品妖孽。\r\n满身心眼儿、油嘴滑舌、白日宣淫，\r\n这就是莫铭对周放终身的定义，周放却乐此不疲。\r\n京腔小调，异国风情，高干与否，都是为了爱情。\r\n两个注定的人，一招一式、一言一行缠绵缭绕，\r\n犹如前生未断的羁绊，难解难分。\r\n内容标签：高干 天之骄子 天作之和 都市情缘", "base": "files/article/html/69/69104", "chapters": [{"title": "1-10", "file": "10557941.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-20", "file": "10557942.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-30", "file": "10557943.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-40", "file": "10557944.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-50", "file": "10557945.html", "available": false}, {"title": "51-60", "file": "10557946.html", "available": false}, {"title": "61-67", "file": "10557947.html", "available": false}, {"title": "68-74", "file": "10557948.html", "available": false}, {"title": "75-80", "file": "10557949.html", "available": false}, {"title": "81-86", "file": "10557950.html", "available": false}, {"title": "87-92", "file": "10557951.html", "available": false}, {"title": "93-97", "file": "10557952.html", "available": false}, {"title": "98-102", "file": "10557953.html", "available": false}, {"title": "103-107", "file": "10557954.html", "available": false}, {"title": "108-111", "file": "10557955.html", "available": false}, {"title": "112-116", "file": "10557956.html", "available": false}, {"title": "117-121", "file": "10557957.html", "available": false}, {"title": "122-125", "file": "10557958.html", "available": false}, {"title": "126-133", "file": "10557959.html", "available": false}, {"title": "134-138", "file": "10557960.html", "available": false}, {"title": "139-144", "file": "10557961.html", "available": false}, {"title": "145-149", "file": "10557962.html", "available": false}, {"title": "150-155", "file": "1055